X. Batchelor?

00:23:39.160 --> 00:23:41.040
Opal told me that's her pen name.

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:45.500
You darling, you sweetheart, you ever-loving little goldmine.

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:48.650
He's here. We just walked in the door.

00:23:49.180 --> 00:23:50.320
It's your office, Susan.

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:53.630
Oh, yes, Susan, we had a wonderful trip.

00:23:54.440 --> 00:23:56.760
He just took his coat off. Thank you.

00:23:57.670 --> 00:23:59.330
That's right. Oh, we had a ball.

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:02.800
Of course, the, uh, curl in the next compartment on the train murdered,

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:04.960
but, uh, I guess that's about par for the North.

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:07.040
Uh, what's on your mind?

00:24:11.760 --> 00:24:14.600
I see. Well, uh, thank you very much, Susan, for the information.

00:24:14.780 --> 00:24:16.220
I'll, uh, I'll make it in this afternoon.

00:24:21.480 --> 00:24:24.180
Susan just located Francis X. Batchelor.

00:24:24.480 --> 00:24:27.580
He's a patient at the Walter Reed Hospital in Washington, D.C.,

00:24:28.430 --> 00:24:29.970
which brings up a very interesting...

00:24:30.000 --> 00:24:32.920
How did his name get on this manuscript?

00:24:36.730 --> 00:24:38.150
Come on, Pam, give.

00:24:38.290 --> 00:24:41.350
I want to know whose idea it was to give Opal Crump a pen name.

00:24:41.490 --> 00:24:42.570
This particular name?

00:24:45.150 --> 00:24:45.730
That figures.

00:24:46.030 --> 00:24:46.470
But why?

00:24:46.650 --> 00:24:47.930
Just to make sure I'd read the book?

00:24:48.900 --> 00:24:51.540
Oh, now, really, Pam, you dragged me in and out of murders,

00:24:51.620 --> 00:24:54.180
trapped me into reading novels written by sweet little old ladies,

00:24:54.240 --> 00:24:58.160
and you anyway.

00:25:13.020 --> 00:25:18.760
Mr. and Mrs. North is directed by Ralph Francis Murphy, a John W. Lovedon production.

00:25:19.990 --> 00:25:26.540
Produced by Federal Telefilm, starring Barbara Britton and Richard Denning, featuring Francis de Sales.

00:25:40.880 --> 00:25:41.720
Film presentation.
